@host = https://localhost:44347
@token = <login'den alınan JWT>

### Mobil: sürüm kontrolü (girişten sonra tek istek)
POST {{host}}/api/Surum/Kontrol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cihazId": "8f1c2b9e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "versionCode": 12, "cihazModeli": "SM-A325F", "androidSurumu": "13" }

### Mobil: APK indir
GET {{host}}/api/Surum/7/Indir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: sürüm listesi
GET {{host}}/api/Surum
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: aktif/pasif
PUT {{host}}/api/Surum/7/Aktiflik
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aktif": false }

### Admin: cihaz listesi
GET {{host}}/api/Cihaz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
